#: crates/linuxflow-platform/src/tray/advice.rs
msgid "Install the package gnome-shell-extension-appindicator (sudo zypper install gnome-shell-extension-appindicator), turn it on in the Extensions application, then log out and back in."
msgstr "Installe le paquet gnome-shell-extension-appindicator (sudo zypper install gnome-shell-extension-appindicator), active-le dans l’application Extensions, puis ferme et rouvre ta session."

#: crates/linuxflow-platform/src/tray/advice.rs
msgid "Install the \"AppIndicator and KStatusNotifierItem Support\" GNOME extension (package gnome-shell-extension-appindicator on most distributions), turn it on in the Extensions application, then log out and back in."
msgstr "Installe l’extension GNOME « AppIndicator and KStatusNotifierItem Support » (paquet gnome-shell-extension-appindicator sur la plupart des distributions), active-la dans l’application Extensions, puis ferme et rouvre ta session."

